3. Architecture Overview
```
Visitor → Homepage (app/page.tsx → HomeApp)
            │
            ├─ fetches partners from /api/partners
            │     └─ reads Supabase `affiliate_partners` (falls back to public/partners.json)
            │
            ├─ search → concierge match (lib/home/concierge-match.ts) + optional AI (/api/chat)
            │     └─ logs search to /api/track/search → Supabase `partner_searches`
            │
            ├─ PartnerMarquee → scrolling logos of FEATURED partners (logo.dev)
            │
            ├─ SupportCenter → support email card (mailto support@signalboostapp.com)
            │
            └─ partner card click → opens affiliate URL in new tab
                  └─ logs click to /api/track/click → Supabase `partner_clicks`

Admin (you) → log in (/auth/login) → AdminBar appears on homepage (email-gated)
            └─ /admin hub → Add Partner form, Statistics dashboard
