6. The AI Concierge
`lib/home/concierge-match.ts` — the matching logic: parses a query for intent/category/destination, filters partners by region + category, ranks them.
`app/api/chat/route.ts` — calls the Anthropic API (model `claude-sonnet-4-6`) for natural-language understanding when needed. Contract: POST `{messages, lang}` → `{reply, partners[]}`. Resolves affiliate URLs by region (`regional_urls[region]` → `["ot"]` worldwide → base `url`).
Region detection: the site detects the visitor's region (e.g. Mérida MX → `es-latam`) and shows partners serving that region. `"ot"` = worldwide/default.
